      "sourceTextSha256": "8c96c7ec66089990dee62af02f6d327b95a88427c1246f22e363f4dc5e793cba",
      "text": "You spend days 2–3 in the Drake Passage, heading south amid cool, salty winds, ocean swells and seabirds. You may encounter fin whales along the way. Look out for wandering, grey-headed, black-browed and light-mantled albatrosses, Cape petrels, southern fulmars, Wilson’s storm petrels, blue petrels and Antarctic petrels.",
